    <statement><p>Find <m>dy/dx</m> by implicit differentiation.</p>
<p><me>\sqrt{x+y}=7 + x^2y^2</me></p>
<p><m>dy/dx =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{1-4xy^{2}\mathopen{}\left(x+y\right)^{0.5}}{4x^{2}y\mathopen{}\left(x+y\right)^{0.5}-1}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
